        <p>R. Kilshaw, first position in college test ex- amination; K. Murtagh, proficiency in office routine and book-keeping; J. Shaw, proficiency in tots and rapid calculations; D. Hulse, rapid improvement in handwriting; Ethel Oakley, prize for 'efforts in selling tickets for the recent College social, in aid of the local Red Cross Society; James -Cunnington and John Bennett, prizes for general progress and good conduct. 'Summary of Certificates.</p>
        <p>Pitman Certificates.--Eleinentary theory, 16; advareed theory, 16; speed, 24. National Shorthand Association.—Elementary theory, 9; advanced theory, 15; speed, 22. National Shorthand Association (Typists' Section).—Junior, 68; senior, 1. Gregg Certificates.—Primary, 18; inter., 1; speed, 10.</p>
