        <p>At IrlQlard Abroad among people of every class of society Beecham's 'Pills have won golden opinions. The universal popularity which Beecham's Pills have achieved is the most striking proof of their worth. It is the people who take the pills who praise them. And surely they should. be in the- best• posit- ion to judge of the merits of the medicine. Lik invariably give satisfaction whenever they have a fair trial. If the directions are followed it will be found that what they promise they perform. As an aperient, a corrective, a dig- estive and a tonic medicine—Beecham's Pills undoubtedly Have a Good Record Sold everywhere in boxes, price Is 3d and 35 Od.</p>
        <p>Read Th.s • Copied from the original by the Proprietors of "The Warrington Examiner" 18th April. 1916_ DEAR MR. WOOD, • Knowing that ,you are always pleased to hear of the successes of any of your Students, I thought you -might be interested to know that I lave.lately had my- wages increased from 17/6 to 22/- per week. As I had not made application for it (which is the custom), or even mentioned the matter to anyone, it came as a pleasant surprise. I am- informed. .by my employer and the Chairman of the, Company that; although Only temporary now I shall be made permanent after the war: Not being' 18 until June, I think this bears a striking, tribute to the efficiency of Wood's College. I have very good prospects and have the assurance of the Council that when I am a little older I shall receive more. Wood's College I shall always recommend as the best in the district, and shall always feel that I owe both this: and all future successes to you. Wishing the College every success, I remain, yours sincerely, F. Wilson Wood, Esq., Wood7s. College, Warrington. For full Particulars respecting Classes, &amp;c., write or call TIIE SECRETARY, WOOD'S COLLEGE, 15, BRIDGE STREET (over Midland Bank), WARRINGTON. • • • •• - Warrington Co-operative Society. SANKEY STREET. We are now shewing an excellent range of LADIES' COSTUMES London style and finish. Prices from 35/6 to 8.5/- Very special line in Ladies' Rainproof Dust Coats in all shades 30/.- each. Guaranteed fast colour. These cannot be repeated.</p>
